WEBVTT

00:09:25.603 --> 00:09:30.190
we did a deeper dive into mentoring
in fanfiction communities.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:37.448
Now, we expected to find traditional
mentor-mentee pairs,

00:09:37.448 --> 00:09:41.785
older or more experienced authors
mentoring younger

00:09:41.785 --> 00:09:43.245
or less experienced ones.

00:09:44.997 --> 00:09:48.125
But what we found
was completely different.

00:09:49.001 --> 00:09:52.880
We found millions of authors
and readers communicating

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.924
via multiple channels

00:09:55.924 --> 00:09:59.553
and reviewing each other’s work

00:09:59.553 --> 00:10:01.513
regardless of experience level.